  message: "Decided (canonicalize: the agent's decision under the item's ask, reported to the owner as theirs to overturn) and built in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108): a language's built-in aliases hash alike unless the file declares the name itself.\nFILED REPROS RE-RUN on dev 39bef1108: C# void f(string s) against void f(System.String s): K.f stable ids DIFFERENT on dev 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108. Swift func f(_ x: Int) against func f(_ x: Swift.Int): DIFFERENT, now SAME. The builder's wider pair fixtures (closure/t/cs_*, swift_*): C# 13 members and Swift 11 members go from DIFFERENT to SAME; C# global:: is covered (root prefix). A C# file without \"using System\" keeps bare String apart (D.G4 stays DIFFERENT, by design).\nMEASURED by the builder: sherpa-onnx scripts/dotnet 177 of 900 ids moved, lwip LwipMibCompiler 17 of 1,007; vapor 3, swift-nio 3. Extended to Go (byte/uint8, rune/int32, any/interface{}), Solidity (uint/uint256, int/int256, byte/bytes1) and Rust (leading ::).\nNOT BUILT, filed: WI-tufih-kubum-lopaz-gadul-gimof-laloz-nalal-dolid (Solidity events and parameter names), WI-zagon-fohad-zadod-gifar-jafoj-zusos-furap-balam (cross-file shadowing, sugar spellings, Julia <: bounds), a note on WI-jogih (C# global:: on a non-built-in path); Julia Base.X, Julia relative paths and Solidity address payable are put to the owner in WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar.\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # 84b5
